---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Website + Local SEO | Oculivo" description="Oculivo pairs a conversion-focused practice website with local SEO, reputation management, call tracking, forms, content, and appointment attribution.">
<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div class="icon-box" aria-hidden="true">⌕</div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Website and local SEO</span>
      <h1>Turn local searches into<br/>booked patients.</h1>
      <p>Oculivo pairs a conversion-focused practice website with local SEO, reputation management, call tracking, forms, content, and appointment attribution.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="https://taxrescrm.app/book?product=oculivo">Request a private demo&nbsp; →</a><a class="secondary" href="/">Explore Oculivo</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="depth">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="depth-head"><span class="eyebrow cyan">One connected platform</span><div><h2>Purpose-built depth.<br/>Practice-wide clarity.</h2><p>Oculivo connects this workflow to scheduling, patient communication, staff operations, reporting, security, and growth—without trapping your team in disconnected systems.</p></div></div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article><span class="num">01</span><h3>Practice website</h3><p>Fast, accessible service and location pages, online booking, provider profiles, bilingual content, and clear calls to action.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article>
        <article><span class="num">02</span><h3>Local visibility</h3><p>Track search performance, listings, reviews, location pages, technical health, and content opportunities.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article>
        <article><span class="num">03</span><h3>Real attribution</h3><p>Connect calls, forms, campaigns, reviews, and appointments so you can see which marketing creates patients.</p><small>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;Connected to the complete patient record</small></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="founding"><div class="wrap"><div class="founding-card"><div><span class="eyebrow cyan">Founding practice program</span><h2>Build the clearer future of eye care<br/>with us.</h2><p>Get a private walkthrough and help shape Oculivo around the workflows your practice actually uses.</p></div><a href="https://taxrescrm.app/book?product=oculivo">Request your private demo&nbsp; →</a></div></div></section>
</main>
</Base>
<style>
.hero{background:#0b0b22;color:white;padding:78px 0 96px;min-height:635px}.hero-inner{text-align:center;max-width:900px}.icon-box{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2ed5d4,#9a64f0 65%,#ee45c5);margin:0 auto 34px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#14142b;font-size:40px;line-height:1}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#26ded8}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(56px,7vw,86px);line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:30px 0 26px}.hero p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#c2bddb;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:34px}.actions a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 20px;font-weight:850;font-size:14px}.actions .primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2fd7d5,#8e82f4);color:#08081d}.actions .secondary{border:1px solid #3d3958;color:white}
.depth{background:#f8f8fc;padding:76px 0 70px}.depth-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}.cyan{color:#26d6d4}.depth h2{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,66px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 54px;color:#0a0a1f;font-weight:500}.depth-head p{color:#69677f;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;max-width:620px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.cards article{background:white;border:1px solid #dedeea;border-radius:20px;padding:30px 30px 28px;min-height:300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.num{font-size:12px;color:#7a55ef;font-weight:900}.cards h3{font-size:22px;margin:34px 0 12px;font-weight:500}.cards p{font-size:14px;color:#67657c;line-height:1.65;margin:0}.cards small{margin-top:auto;color:#4b3d94;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
.founding{background:#f8f8fc;padding:24px 0 90px}.founding-card{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#3b276d 0%,#17152f 58%,#0e4450 100%);border-radius:28px;color:white;padding:62px 66px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px}.founding-card h2{font-size:clamp(46px,5vw,62px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-weight:500;margin:20px 0 18px}.founding-card p{font-size:17px;color:#d7d4e7;line-height:1.6;max-width:650px}.founding-card>a{background:white;color:#0b0b1f;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}
@media(max-width:900px){.depth-head,.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.depth h2{margin-bottom:18px}.founding-card{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.hero h1 br,.founding-card h2 br{display:none}}
</style>